  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3102.12 Professional development",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-05-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3102.12 “Professional development” means approved college courses, in-service seminars or workshops, institutes or research that are directly related to driver education or the improvement of instructional skills.\n\nSource. #7362, eff 12-1-00; ss by #9331, INTERIM, eff 11-26-08, EXPIRED: 5-25-09\n\nNew. #9568, eff 10-17-09; ss by #12509, eff 4-5-18 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 3100)",
